    <briefdescription>
<para>For each memory instruction, this class maintains difference of the number of unsafe dependences that start out from this instruction minus those that end here. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>By traversing the memory instructions in program order and accumulating this number, we know whether any unsafe dependence crosses over a program point. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
